    "CoiStatement": "Compliance with ethical standards Since there were only secondary data analyses employed without any participant\u2019s personal information identified by extracting statistical data from the UK Data Archive website in the present study, no further ethics approval for conducting the present study was required (more details via http://www.ethicsguidebook.ac.uk/Secondary-analysis-106). Conflict of interest The authors declare that they have no conflict of interest.",
